      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Blairsburg Lake, nicknamed “Shotgun Lake” for past hunting mishaps, remains a local favorite for fishing and recreation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
